<title>JAPAN: Japan's Nov household spending rises real 1.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Japan's Nov household spending rises real 1.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's household spending in November rose 1.7 percent in real terms from a year earlier to an average 309,002 yen per household, the government's Management and Coordination Agency said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The following is a breakdown of year-on-year percentage changes in real and nominal terms:</p>
<p>					     Nov		   Oct</p>
<p>					 Real   Nominal    Real   Nominal</p>
<p> Overall household spending   +1.7    +2.0	-1.5    -1.2</p>
<p>(average 309,002 yen)  Spending by wage earners     +3.1    +3.4	-0.1    +0.2</p>
<p>(average 325,260 yen)</p>
</text>
